# x0_per_layer_base: baseline of the per-layer arm. No lever.
# x1 runs a different program (bert_perlayer_cpu.py; measured script md5 = program identity), so the arm
# has its own baseline. s0_default: whole-model conversion; x0: fourteen pieces (retired 02_per_layer,
# never gated). Model, sequence length, all-ones mask, seeds, gate observable, threads identical.
SHAFT_SCRIPT=$BASE/bert_perlayer_cpu.py
